  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A shop on [ianfoxdev/outbox](https://github.com/IanFoxDev/outbox), running in the open.** A Laravel shop records `OrderPlaced` and `OrderPaid` in the same transaction as the order. Two replicas of the relay publish them to Kafka: one leads, the other waits to take over. A consumer adds up what every customer paid, once per event. A script places 1 to 4 orders a second; 2 in 100 checkouts fail and roll back, 1 in 14 orders is paid twice, as a double click would, and the second payment is refused.\n\nIf an event were lost or counted twice, the money in the shop and the money the consumer counted would drift apart. *Customers whose totals disagree* counts customers whose last payment is over a minute old and whose two totals differ. It should stay at 0."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Paid in the shop",
      "description": "Sum of all paid orders, kept by a trigger in the transaction that marks the order paid.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "shop"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "shop"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "SELECT paid_in_shop / 100.0 AS value FROM demo_stats.money"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyEUR",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2,
